<title>GREECE: ATHENS BOURSE QUESTIONS ELVIEMEK RALLY.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BOURSE QUESTIONS ELVIEMEK RALLY.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange board decided to ask the bourse supervisor's office to look into transactions in shares of Elviemek which have rallied recently, it said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bourse will also ask the company to explain the rise in its share's price and report any facts of substance, it said.</p>
<p>-- George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
